<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1707534384"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:59.561"><div begin="23.937" end="44.545" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="23.937" end="27.897" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.937" end="25.773">你口口声声</span><span begin="25.773" end="26.927">的说爱</span><span begin="26.927" end="27.897">我</span></p><p begin="30.192" end="34.425" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.192" end="32.945">却把承诺奉献给</span><span begin="32.945" end="34.425">别人</span></p><p begin="35.836" end="40.120" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.836" end="38.507">在经过你的解释</span><span begin="38.507" end="39.086">之</span><span begin="39.086" end="40.120">后</span></p><p begin="41.873" end="44.545" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.873" end="43.360">我选择带</span><span begin="43.360" end="44.545">过</span></p></div><div begin="47.983" end="1:09.226" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="47.983" end="51.943" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.983" end="49.819">你口口声声</span><span begin="49.819" end="50.973">的说爱</span><span begin="50.973" end="51.943">我</span></p><p begin="53.959" end="58.543" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.959" end="56.601">却让渡寂寞销魂</span><span begin="56.601" end="57.015">夜</span><span begin="57.015" end="58.543">晚</span></p><p begin="59.890" end="1:04.417" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.890" end="1:02.944">在经过你的自责之</span><span begin="1:02.944" end="1:04.417">后</span></p><p begin="1:05.838" end="1:09.226" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.838" end="1:07.449">我空白记</span><span begin="1:07.449" end="1:09.226">忆</span></p></div><div begin="1:11.927" end="1:33.062" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:11.927" end="1:16.157" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.927" end="1:13.780">你口口声声</span><span begin="1:13.780" end="1:15.166">的说爱</span><span begin="1:15.166" end="1:16.157">我</span></p><p begin="1:17.844" end="1:22.553" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span beg